# Build artifacts and tool-generated dirs — never send to the Docker build context.
target/
**/.codesearch.db/
**/.fastembed_cache/
.git/
.github/
helpers/
docs/
tests/
**/*.md
# rmcp's lib does include_str!("../README.md") — the vendored crate cannot
# compile without it.
!vendor/rmcp/README.md
# Hidden tool dirs
.*/
**/.*/
!.dockerignore
